    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287840/extras/6d27dc523384cdaf977cdc375e02fe13.avif?t=1731289394\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Four Arithmetic Operations Exercises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Automatically Generate Questions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Answer Choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Props Assistance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Short Plot Stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Infinite Practice Mode (Requirement: Complete All Towers And Reach The 50Th Floor To Unlock This Mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Multiple Difficulty Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. Have Fun While Learning, Learn While Having Fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. There Are Also Cute Monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Let Time Force You To Calculate?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3287840/extras/6d27dc523384cdaf977cdc375e02fe13.avif?t=1731289394\" width=128 height=128 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Four Arithmetic Operations Exercises</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Automatically Generate Questions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Answer Choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Props Assistance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Short Plot Stories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Infinite Practice Mode (Requirement: Complete All Towers And Reach The 50Th Floor To Unlock This Mode)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >7. Multiple Difficulty Modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >8. Have Fun While Learning, Learn While Having Fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >9. There Are Also Cute Monsters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10. Let Time Force You To Calculate?</p></li></ul>",
